{"entries":[{"name":"ジョバンニ","reading":"じょばんに","category":"character","keys":["ジョバンニ","ジョバンニさん"],"content":"A schoolboy in the afternoon class who is sleepy and has little time or books to read because of his work in the mornings and afternoons. When the teacher asks about the Milky Way, he raises his hand but cannot answer, and he turns red in embarrassment while ザネリ giggles at him. He remembers that he and カムパネルラ once read about the galaxy together, and he feels that カムパネルラ did not answer because he was being kind to him, given how much he has withdrawn from friends. He hurries home to a small house in a back-alley town, where his ill mother is resting in bed and his older sister has left food for him. He buys sugar cubes for his mother's milk and eats tomatoes and bread alone. He hopes his father will return soon, since a newspaper reported good northern fishing this year. Classmates tease him about the sea otter coat his father promised him, but カムパネルラ never joins in and looks sympathetic when others do. ジョバンニ still delivers newspapers each morning, and he fondly remembers visiting カムパネルラ's house after school to play with his alcohol-powered model train. On the night of the galaxy festival he goes out with カムパネルラ to see the floating lanterns, promising to be back in about an hour and a half. When he hears a child has fallen into the river, he runs to the riverbank in a panic, where マルソ tells him that カムパネルラ jumped in after ザネリ and has not been found."},{"name":"カムパネルラ","reading":"かむぱねるら","category":"character","keys":["カムパネルラ","カムパネルラさん"],"content":"A classmate of ジョバンニ who eagerly raises his hand in class but cannot answer when the teacher calls on him. He is the son of 博士, and he and ジョバンニ once read a magazine and a large book about the galaxy together at his house. ジョバンニ believes カムパネルラ knew the answer but stayed silent out of pity, since ジョバンニ has been less friendly and talkative lately. ジョバンニ's father and カムパネルラ's father were friends since childhood, and ジョバンニ's father once took him to カムパネルラ's house. カムパネルラ has a model train powered by an alcohol lamp, and ジョバンニ often stopped by after school to see it. He never teases ジョバンニ about his father and looks uncomfortable when others do. On the night of the galaxy festival he goes with ジョバンニ to float lanterns on the river. When ザネリ falls from the boat, カムパネルラ dives in right away and pushes ザネリ back toward the boat, where カトウ grabs her. Afterward カムパネルラ cannot be found in the river, and the search continues with his father watching the water."},{"name":"ザネリ","reading":"ざねり","category":"character","keys":["ザネリ"],"content":"A classmate who sits in the seat in front of ジョバンニ. When ジョバンニ fails to answer the teacher's question, ザネリ looks back and giggles at him. On the night of the galaxy festival, she is on a boat trying to push a 烏瓜 lantern out onto the water when the boat rocks and she falls into the river. カムパネルラ jumps in and pushes her back to the boat, where カトウ holds her. She is later taken home."},{"name":"博士","reading":"はかせ","category":"character","keys":["博士","カムパネルラのお父さん"],"content":"The father of カムパネルラ, referred to as a doctor. He has a study with large books, and カムパネルラ fetches a big book from it to look at pictures of the galaxy with ジョバンニ. On the night カムパネルラ disappears in the river, he stands at the riverbank surrounded by students and townspeople. He has a pale, pointed chin, wears black clothes, and stands very straight, staring at a watch in his right hand as everyone searches the water."},{"name":"マルソ","reading":"まるそ","category":"character","keys":["マルソ"],"content":"A classmate who was with ジョバンニ and カムパネルラ earlier on the night of the galaxy festival. He runs to ジョバンニ at the riverbank and explains that ザネリ fell from a boat while trying to push a 烏瓜 lantern into the current, that カムパネルラ jumped in and pushed ザネリ back to the boat, and that カムパネルラ then could not be seen. He tells ジョバンニ that カムパネルラ's father and many others have come to search, but that ザネリ has already been taken home."},{"name":"カトウ","reading":"かとう","category":"character","keys":["カトウ"],"content":"A boy who grabs ザネリ when she falls into the river and holds her at the boat, after カムパネルラ pushes her toward him. He is mentioned by マルソ as the one who caught her."},{"name":"銀河","reading":"ぎんが","category":"term","keys":["銀河","天の川","銀河帯","乳の流れ","銀河のお祭"],"content":"The faint white band of light across the night sky, also called the Milky Way (天の川). In class the teacher explains that through a large telescope it appears as many small stars, and that its stars are like grains of sand in a river or fat globules in milk. The teacher says that the Earth and Sun float within this band, so people live inside the Milky Way, which looks whiter where it is deeper and more distant. The teacher describes the galaxy as lens-shaped, with the Sun near its middle, and says its stars are suns that shine on their own like ours. The class is told that the lens's size and its stars will be covered in the next science lesson. The teacher also says the day is a galaxy festival, and the students are encouraged to go outside and look at the sky. On the night of the festival, the Milky Way is reflected across the wide river, looking like a sky with no water in it."},{"name":"ジョバンニのお母さん","reading":"じょばんにのおかあさん","category":"character","keys":["ジョバンニのお母さん","お母さん"],"content":"ジョバンニ's mother, who is ill and rests in bed in the front room of their small house. She is grateful for the sugar cubes and asks him to eat first, saying she does not want anything yet. She tells him that his sister came home around three o'clock and left tomato food for him. ジョバンニ asks whether her milk was delivered, and she is unsure. She tells him that his father once promised him a sea otter coat. On the night of the galaxy festival she lets him go out to see the lanterns, telling him to play more with カムパネルラ, since he is with him and will be safe. She suggests closing the window because it has gotten cool, and warns him not to go into the river."}]}
